<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 72-3 V WEST INDIES IN FIRST TEST - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 72-3 V WEST INDIES IN FIRST TEST - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 72 for three at lunch after being put in to bat by West Indies, on the first day of the first cricket test at St John's recreation ground on Friday.</p>
</text>
